Z||000000||Screwie||12-09-2001||11:50 AM||||I just wanted to show off my first ever try at 3D design! I made a Corvette, cause it wouldn't matter if I screwed it up or not, if I had done a Fiero and screwed it up, I'd feel bad  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> Anyways, here is the pic. <P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/corv.jpg"> <P>I'm currently tweaking it, so it'll work better in Midtown Madness 2. If everything works out (I already have the car working in MM2) then, yups you guessed it, our beloved Fiero is next  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||1
