Z||000005||Mark Matthews||12-10-2001||09:58 AM||||Glad to see other modellers on the forum.  I do computer animation for an architectural company out here in Vegas.  Here's an image a co-worker and I did for a casino in Vegas.<BR> <A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/mark_fglv/3d_Renderings.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.geocities.com/mark_fglv/3d_Renderings.html</A> <P>I use 3D Max 4.2, and finalRender for the global illumination.  The people are cut out of magazines, that's why it looks like a fashion show!     <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>Lets see more stuff!<P>(edit) - Forgot Geocities doesn't allow linking, follow the link at the page it will take you there.<P>------------------<BR>Mark Matthews<BR>'87 GT Fastback T-top<p>[This message has been edited by Mark Matthews (edited 12-10-2001).]||||reg||1
